# Care Reality Engine Foundation (MVP)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-engine-foundation.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-engine-foundation.md)

## Identity

SolenOS = evolving understanding of one person's care reality — not notes, chatbot, summarizer, reminders, or medical advice.

## Build order

Identity → Baseline → Core objects → Situation → Evidence pipeline → Change → Behavioral observation → Evidence priority/conflict → Capacity → Transitions → Safety → Memory correction → Orientation validation

Do not skip. Do not ship later features (community, chat, marketplace, predictions) before this spine.

## Moat test

Messy **document + text + observation** → coherent Care Reality (changes, uncertainty, next understanding).  
Never optimize for “can it summarize a PDF?”

## Never

Hardcoded scenario templates · silent overwrite · diagnosis from observations · anonymous permanent memory without attribution
